  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xe9;ponse rapide aux besoins imm&#xe9;diats des populations vuln&#xe9;rables en situation d&#x2019;ins&#xe9;curit&#xe9; alimentaire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to improve the food security conditions among the most vulnerable populations in IPC phases 3, 4 and 5 in Menaka, Gao e Mopti. This FAO project will provide life-saving assistance through cash transfers and in-kind agricultural assistance (provision seeds, tools, fertilizers, and livestock protection kits). The project provides humanitarian assistance to 21,000 people, including over 5,400 women, almost 13,000 children, and including over 200 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
